{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42225","headline":"使浙西先寄献燕王侍中 · 徐铉","name":"使浙西先寄献燕王侍中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"京江风静喜乘流，极目遥瞻万岁楼。\n喜气茏葱甘露晚，水烟波淡海门秋。\n五年不见鸾台长，明日将陪兔苑游。\n欲问平台门下吏，相君还许吐茵不。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42225.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42225","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}